{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-85381","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118419","text":"Naming the residency"}]},{"id":"blk-85382","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118420","text":"Working brainstorm. The goal is a name that is "},{"id":"spn-118421","marks":["italic"],"text":"entailed by"},{"id":"spn-118422","text":" the thesis and value system below — not decoration. A good name here should make the differentiator (\"user-owned, persistent agents producing grounded findings over a real corpus\") feel inevitable."}]},{"id":"blk-85383","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118423","text":"1. Thesis"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-85385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118424","text":"A place where "},{"id":"spn-118425","marks":["bold"],"text":"persistent, user-owned agents live"},{"id":"spn-118426","text":", reason over a "},{"id":"spn-118427","marks":["bold"],"text":"real corpus"},{"id":"spn-118428","text":", and collaboratively produce "},{"id":"spn-118429","marks":["bold"],"text":"grounded, auditable findings"},{"id":"spn-118430","text":" — with no central server and no coordination required for replicas to converge."}]}],"id":"blk-85384","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-85386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118431","text":"The runtime (TRVM / interaction-calculus reduction) is the "},{"id":"spn-118432","marks":["italic"],"text":"engine for the memory"},{"id":"spn-118433","text":", not the headline. The product is the "},{"id":"spn-118434","marks":["bold"],"text":"inhabited place + the knowledge it emits"},{"id":"spn-118435","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-85387","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118436","text":"2. Value system (what the name must protect)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-85389","spans":[{"id":"spn-118437","text":"Value"}]},{"id":"blk-85390","spans":[{"id":"spn-118438","text":"Why it's load-bearing"}]},{"id":"blk-85391","spans":[{"id":"spn-118439","text":"Source in the work"}]}],"id":"blk-85388","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-85392","spans":[{"id":"spn-118440","marks":["bold"],"text":"Persistence / endurance"}]},{"id":"blk-85393","spans":[{"id":"spn-118441","text":"Agents are "},{"id":"spn-118442","marks":["italic"],"text":"residents"},{"id":"spn-118443","text":", not disposable chat turns. History is the moat."}]},{"id":"blk-85394","spans":[{"id":"spn-118444","text":"resident rail, presence, BroadcastChannel board"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85395","spans":[{"id":"spn-118445","marks":["bold"],"text":"Groundedness / auditability"}]},{"id":"blk-85396","spans":[{"id":"spn-118446","text":"Every finding cites a real file or paper, and can be "},{"id":"spn-118447","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-118448","text":" (ic32 reduce_ic tool). The ⌕ context inspector and ⬇ evidence bundle exist for this."}]},{"id":"blk-85397","spans":[{"id":"spn-118449","marks":["code"],"text":"FINDINGS.md"},{"id":"spn-118450","text":" discipline; reduce_ic tool; evidence bundle"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85398","spans":[{"id":"spn-118451","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereignty"}]},{"id":"blk-85399","spans":[{"id":"spn-118452","text":"Runs client-side in any browser, user-owned, no server required."}]},{"id":"blk-85400","spans":[{"id":"spn-118453","text":"WASM substrate; \"sovereign substrate an open agent stack wants\" (README)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85401","spans":[{"id":"spn-118454","marks":["bold"],"text":"Confluence / coordination-free"}]},{"id":"blk-85402","spans":[{"id":"spn-118455","text":"Order doesn't matter; replicas converge without consensus. The merge is a CvRDT."}]},{"id":"blk-85403","spans":[{"id":"spn-118456","marks":["code"],"text":"semilattice.py"},{"id":"spn-118457","text":", "},{"id":"spn-118458","marks":["code"],"text":"swarm.js"},{"id":"spn-118459","text":", CALM"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85404","spans":[{"id":"spn-118460","marks":["bold"],"text":"Knowledge over chat"}]},{"id":"blk-85405","spans":[{"id":"spn-118461","text":"The output is a "},{"id":"spn-118462","marks":["italic"],"text":"finding"},{"id":"spn-118463","text":" with evidence/provenance/confidence, not a transcript."}]},{"id":"blk-85406","spans":[{"id":"spn-118464","text":"findings board, typed deliverables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85407","spans":[{"id":"spn-118465","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inhabitation / community"}]},{"id":"blk-85408","spans":[{"id":"spn-118466","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-118467","marks":["italic"],"text":"place"},{"id":"spn-118468","text":" with presence, movement, relationships — not a tool you invoke."}]},{"id":"blk-85409","spans":[{"id":"spn-118469","text":"\"a board its agents live on\""}]}]]},{"id":"blk-85410","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118470","text":"3. Naming criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-85411","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118471","text":"A. "},{"id":"spn-118472","marks":["bold"],"text":"Double meaning that encodes the thesis"},{"id":"spn-118473","text":" — best names carry the product story in the dictionary definition. B. "},{"id":"spn-118474","marks":["bold"],"text":"Place-as-noun"},{"id":"spn-118475","text":" — you can say \"open the ___\" / \"in the ___\". It must feel inhabitable. C. "},{"id":"spn-118476","marks":["bold"],"text":"Not crowded in the AI-agent / memory space"},{"id":"spn-118477","text":" (collision-checked below). D. "},{"id":"spn-118478","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereign tone"},{"id":"spn-118479","text":" — public, open, non-corporate. Closer to \"commons\" than \"platform\". E. "},{"id":"spn-118480","marks":["bold"],"text":"One word, pronounceable, ownable handle."}]},{"id":"blk-85412","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118481","text":"4. Candidates + collision research (June 2026)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-85414","spans":[{"id":"spn-118482","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-85415","spans":[{"id":"spn-118483","text":"Thesis fit"}]},{"id":"blk-85416","spans":[{"id":"spn-118484","text":"Collision check"}]},{"id":"blk-85417","spans":[{"id":"spn-118485","text":"Verdict"}]}],"id":"blk-85413","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-85418